# The patches the build may apply, accepted by the user (README.md deviations; analyst AFTER fabricx rows 3-4). Any other, extra or modified patch fails rdbi-image.yml.
# fsc-full-certificate.patch: INTERIM, removed at S15 (analyst Q17): genesis C carries known_certs=1 per org (endorser-<N> cert, `cfgupdate inspect`), so the full-certificate workaround may go; the S15 check then requires 4 patches. If the S15 proof fails it is PERMANENT on this channel (cfgupdate cannot write known_certs, main.go:1-21), like ids/anon.
